'''Mourners''' are [[elves]] who have joined the [[Prifddinas]] Death Guard. These attackable mourners are located in the [[Arandar Pass]] and in the [[Mourner Tunnels]], and drop the [[mourner outfit]], used in [[Mourning's End Part I]] and [[Mourning's End Part II|Part II]]. As a side note, use caution when fighting the level 11 mourners as they will drain all your [[combat]] stats (including [[Hitpoints]]) to 20 when attacked, along with the message {{mes|The Mourner throws a vial at you. You feel weakened.}}. Different, non-attackable [[mourner (Biohazard)|mourners]] can be found all throughout [[West Ardougne]].

The level 108 mourners located in the basement of the [[Mourner HQ]] are considered [[Elf warrior]]s, so their stats and drop table are the same as an Elf warrior, with the exception of ensouled heads and seeds. They will also count towards an elf slayer task. After [[Mourning's End Part II]], the basement can be accessed easily by selecting the [[Dark beast]]s teleport on a [[slayer ring]], and running through the door to the east. After completing [[Song of the Elves]], the mourners will no longer be there.

